hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"882","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ne maweshi ke janwar ki milkiyat ka da'wa kiya aur donon ne do do gawah pesh kiye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke woh donon mein barabar taqseem kiya jae."
"883","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo ita'at se nikle aur jama'at se alag ho woh jahiliyyat ki maut mara. Jo andhe jhande ke neeche lade, qabailiyyat ke liye ghusse mein aae, qabailiyyat ki taraf bulae, aur qatl kiya jae to woh jahiliyyat ki maut mara. Aur jo meri ummat par baghawat kare, un ke naik aur bure ko mare, momin ka us ke iman ki wajah se lihaaz na kare, na muahid se ahad ka ehtiram kare, to woh mujh se nahin hai, aur main us se nahin hun.'"
"884","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo ita'at se nikal jae aur jama'at se alag ho jata hai woh jahiliyyat ki maut marta hai. Aur jo meri ummat par talwar uthae, naik aur bure ko yaksan mare, aur jis ka ahad ho us ke ahad ka ehtiram na kare, woh meri ummat se nahin hai. Aur jo andhe jhande ke neeche qatl kiya jae, qabailiyyat ke liye ghussa zahir kare, qabailiyyat ke liye lade, aur qabailiyyat ki taraf bulae, agar woh mare to woh jahiliyyat ki maut marta hai.'"
"885","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Bani Israil ke nabi un ki siyasi qayadat karte the. Jab bhi koi nabi wafat pata to doosra nabi us ka janasheen hota. Lekin mere baad koi nabi nahin hoga.' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir kya hoga? Aap ne farmaya: 'Khalifa honge aur woh bahut honge. Un ke huqooq ada karo, aur Allah se apne huqooq mango.'"
"886","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mere baad koi nabi nahin hoga.' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir kya hoga? Aap ne farmaya: 'Ek ke baad ek naib honge; to jo un mein se seedha rahe, us ki bai'at par qayam raho; aur jo seedha na rahe, use us ka haq do, aur Allah se apna haq mango.'"
"887","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne poocha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Aap ke baad yeh muamla (khilafat) kaisa hoga?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tak tumhari qaum mein khair hai, yeh muamla tumhari qaum mein rahega.' Main ne poocha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Arbon mein se sab se jald kaun halak hoga?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhari qaum.' Main ne poocha: 'Woh kaise?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Maut un ke liye halal samjhi jayegi aur logon se hasad.'"
"888","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Husain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Arafah ke maidan mein khutba dete dekha. Aap farma rahe the: 'Agar tum par naak kata Habshi ghulam muqarrar ho jae to us ki suno aur us ki ita'at karo, jab tak woh tum mein Allah ka deen qaim kare.'"
"889","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Husain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pichli riwayat ki manind farmate suna."
"890","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Husain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hajjatul Wada' mein dekha, Aap logon ko khutba de rahe the, aur Aap chadar pahne hue the jise Aap ne apni baghal ke neeche lapeta tha, aur Aap ke bazu ka pathha kaanp raha tha. Aur main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Suno aur ita'at karo, agarche tum par naak kaan kate Habshi ghulam ko tumhara rehnuma/hakim muqarrar kiya jae, jab tak woh tum mein Kitabullah qaim kare.'"
"891","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Husain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha — phir rawi ne pichli hadees ki manind zikr ki."
